{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The greedy colouring with some colours fixed in advance (rustworkx"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graph_greedy_color(preset_color_fn=)"},{"type":"text","text":"): "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presetColor"},{"type":"text","text":" gives a vertex’s colour, or nil to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leave it to the strategy. Preset vertices keep their colours and count as coloured from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"start; the others are coloured as by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedyColoring(strategy:)"},{"type":"text","text":", each taking the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"colour no coloured neighbour has. The orders of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".largestFirst"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".smallestLast"},{"type":"text","text":" and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connected sequential strategies are those of the whole graph with the preset vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skipped (rustworkx’s largest first: whole-graph degrees, preset vertices left out);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"DSatur counts preset colours in saturation from the start (rustworkx’s saturation);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".independentSet"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s class k starts without the neighbours of the vertices preset to k"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(rustworkx’s independent set); "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".coloredNeighbors"},{"type":"text","text":" counts preset neighbours as coloured and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes its first vertex from its heap. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"colorCount"},{"type":"text","text":" is one more than the greatest colour,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so preset colours may leave some colours unused. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presetColor"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per vertex,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order. The strategy’s time, plus O(n + m) to check the presets."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"greedyColoring","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"strategy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/ColoringStrategy","text":"ColoringStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14ColoringModule0A8StrategyO"},{"text":" = .largestFirst, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"presetColor","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/Coloring","text":"Coloring","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14ColoringModule0A0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every preset colour is non-negative, and no two adjacent vertices have the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same preset colour."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}]}],"kind":"symbol","va